-- Seed: Indian food catalogue (ENT-16, BR-NUT-08). Macros are per 100 g of the
-- prepared dish (cooked, unless the name says raw/roasted), figures rounded
-- from IFCT 2017 / USDA-adjacent tables. default_serving lets a user log
-- "1 roti" or "1 idli" without knowing gram weights. Stable ids (f0…01 onward)
-- so a re-seed upserts rather than duplicating. Energy stays as the source's
-- stated figure; per-item energy at log time is recomputed by Atwater in
-- @plantpal/shared and frozen on the meal_item row.

